---
layout: base.njk
title: Newsletter Archive
description: Every edition of The Lenches weekly newsletter, newest first.
---
<main class="container">
  <section>
    <h1>Newsletter Archive</h1>
    <p class="lead">Every edition, newest first. Each one opens in your browser exactly as it appeared in the email.</p>
    <div class="card">
      <ul class="newsletter-archive mt0">
        {% for item in newsletters %}
        <li><a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.label }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
